AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0002130> "A general relation between a neuron and some structure in which it either chemically synapses to some target or in which it receives (chemical) synaptic input.")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0002130> "has synaptic terminal in"@en)
