AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0002156> "d derived_by_descent_from a if d is specified by some genetic program that is sequence-inherited-from a genetic program that specifies a.")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0002156> "derived by descent from")
SubObjectPropertyOf(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0002156> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0002320>)
