# Object Property: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0002162> (in taxon)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0002162> "x is in taxon y if an only if y is an organism, and the relationship between x and y is one of: part of (reflexive), developmentally preceded by, derives from, secreted by, expressed.")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0002162> "in taxon")
SubObjectPropertyOf(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0002162> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0002320>)

# Object Property: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0002163> (spatially disjoint from)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0002163> "A is spatially_disjoint_from B if and only if they have no parts in common")
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000116> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0002163> "There are two ways to encode this as a shortcut relation. The other possibility to use an annotation assertion between two classes, and expand this to a disjointness axiom. "@en)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0002163> "spatially disjoint from")
SubObjectPropertyOf(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0002163> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0002323>)

# Object Property: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0002170> (connected to)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0002170> "a is connected to b if and only if a and b are discrete structure, and there exists some connecting structure c, such that c connects a and b")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0002170> "connected to"@en)
SubObjectPropertyOf(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0002170> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0002323>)
ObjectPropertyDomain(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0002170> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000050> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0002577>))
ObjectPropertyRange(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0002170> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000050> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0002577>))

# Object Property: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0002176> (connects)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0002176> "c connects a if and only if there exist some b such that a and b are similar parts of the same system, and c connects b, specifically, c connects a with b. When one structure connects two others it unites some aspect of the function or role they play within the system.")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0002176> "connects"@en)
SubObjectPropertyOf(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0002176> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0002323>)
ObjectPropertyDomain(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0002176> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000004>)
ObjectPropertyRange(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0002176> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000050> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0002577>))

# Object Property: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0002177> (attached to part of)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0002177> "a is attached to part of b if a is attached to b, or a is attached to some p, where p is part of b.")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0002177> "attached to part of"@en)
SubObjectPropertyOf(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0002177> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0002323>)
