AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000116> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0002595> "Do not use this relation directly. It is intended as a grouping for a diverse set of relations, all involving cause and effect.")
