AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0004030> "A relationship between a disease and an anatomical structure where the material basis of the disease is some pathological change in the structure. Anatomical structure includes cellular and sub-cellular entities, such as chromosome and organelles.")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0004030> "disease arises from alteration in structure")
