AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0009501> "r 'realized in response to' s iff, r is a realizable (e.g. a plant trait such as responsivity to drought), s is an environmental stimulus (a process), and s directly causes the realization of r.")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0009501> "realized in response to"@en)
SubObjectPropertyOf(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0009501> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0002410>)
ObjectPropertyDomain(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0009501> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000017>)
ObjectPropertyRange(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0009501> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000015>)

