AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0014001> "A relationship between a disease and an infectious agent where the material basis of the disease is an infection with some infectious agent.")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0014001> "disease has infectious agent")
