AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHEBI_23359> "An  alkaloid that is a carbotricyclic compound comprising 5,6,7,9-tetrahydrobenzo[<em>a</em>]heptalene having four methoxy substituents at the 1-, 2-, 3- and 10-positions as well as an oxo group at the 9-position and an acetamido group at the 7-position. It has been isolated from the plants belonging to genus <em>Colchicum</em>.")
