AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_00002373> "A meal type is the name of an eating occasion that may have location, food type, or other customary contextual features. (Damion's 1st draft definition)"@en)
