AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03400139> "A multiple-component food product typically containing a protein source, a vegetable, and a potato, rice or cereal-based component packaged to be served after heating, either as separate items or courses or mixed as recipe components; see 21 CFR 102.26, 102.28 and 104.47 for nutritional quality guidelines."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03400139> "multicomponent meal (us cfr)"@en)
SubClassOf(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03400139> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03400172>)

