# Class: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03411134> (mammal)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03411134> "Mammals (from Latin mamma \"breast\") are vertebrate animals constituting the class Mammalia, and characterized by the presence of mammary glands which in females produce milk for feeding (nursing) their young, a neocortex (a region of the brain), fur or hair, and three middle ear bones."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03411134> "mammal"@en)
SubClassOf(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03411134> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_00005501>)
SubClassOf(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03411134> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03411297>)

