# Class: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03420237> (floret or flower)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03420237> "The pigmented blossom of a plant that contains the reproductive  organs; a floret is a single flower of a multiple flowered inflorescence. Also includes flower buds."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03420237> "floret or flower"@en)
