AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03460130> "A food modification process where physical or chemical changes are effected in any food ingredient through a physical or non-enzymatic chemical process."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03460130> "physical/chemical modification process"@en)
