AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_5200263> "An excessive increase in motivated and goal directed as well as non-goal directed behaviors that are usually accompanied by elevated energy and interest that allows individuals to get started, be energized to perform a sustained and directed action. The increase is often disruptive and typically results in unfavorable consequences.")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_5200263> "Abnormally increased volition")
SubClassOf(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_5200263> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0025780>)

